			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				950
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <i>foreign country,</i>
			
