					14.4
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ξ. καταβιοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.146S.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
